{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "She saw him? In the love hotel?": "",
  "Well, she says she saw the flash of his camera and looked out the hotel window...": "",
  "He had apparently affixed himself to the wall... And then he crawled away like a cockroach!": "",
  "A cockroach? How in the world?": "",
  "I couldn't tell you. But we have to act fast, or he'll upload her pictures for the whole world to see!": "",
  "All right. I can see why you were so serious about it this time.": "",
  "I'll be charging the usual 50,000 yen. Can you pay it?": "",
  "Yes! I'll pay whatever it takes.": "",
  "The video was taken at a love hotel called the Top of Ocean Hotel. That's the only lead I have.": "",
  "All right. Guess I'll go see what I can find. No promises, though.": "",
  "It's in your hands, Yagami-san.": "",
  "(Couldn't hurt to go have a look around the hotel. Maybe I'll find a clue as to how he attached himself to a wall...)": "",
  "Wait... That's... him?": "",
  "Oh, dear god! I've never seen anything so perverted!　": "",
  "Unforgiveable! I pronounce these heathens... guilty as charged!": "",
  "I'm actually kind of impressed he made it up that high...": "",
  "Well, guess I'll shoot him down with the Pigeon. He'll live. Probably.": "",
  "Aghhhhh!": "",
  "Whoa, he's fast!": "",
  "W-What the hell? The cockroach thing wasn't far off...": "",
  "He couldn't have gotten far, though. I'm on it!": "",
  "Whoa! People can bend that way!? I'm kinda jealous...": "",
  "He's still at it... Guess I'll try shooting him down.": "",
  "Oh noooooooo!": "",
  "You! Are you the one who did this!?": "",
  "You've interfered with my righteous arbitration, and I find you guilty of obstruction of justice!": "",
  "Sorry, but peeping toms don't get to make those kinds of calls.": "",
  "This time, you're the one on trial.": "",
  "Silence! Order in the court! The defendant is guilty of contempt!": "",
  "And I'm going to be the judge, jury... and executioner!": "",
  "Yagami-san, you did it! Thank you so much!": "",
  "I think it's safe to say that video won't be appearing on any social feeds.": "",
  "Oh, thank god. No one should be subjected to what went on in there...": "",
  "Didn't you say Tsukino was the victim? How would you know what \"went on in there\"?": "",
  "Oh! ...Um, that's... Well, you see...": "",
  "Huh? Yagami-san?": "",
  "Shit!! Tsukino!?": "",
  "Oh, hey, Yosuke. What's going on?": "",
  "Tsukino-san... I'd heard you were too depressed to even leave the house.": "",
  "Depressed? Why would I be depressed?": "",
  "Well, Yosuke here says you were the victim of Judge Creep 'n Peep...": "",
  "Judge what now? You're scaring me...": "",
  "Oh no, I was just talking about Yosuke's job. He said you and your boyfriend got caught in a tryst.": "",
  "What!? A t-tryst!? I don't know anything about this!": "",
  "Uh... Ergh...": "",
  "Yosuke! Care to explain this one!?": "",
  "Uh... Ahaha... I'm sorry. I lied about Tsukino being the victim...": "",
  "Wh-What!? Why would you do that!?": "",
  "Let's not be hasty...": "",
  "Now that I think about it...": "",
  "Is that how you knew what \"went on\" in there?": "",
  "Ha... Nothing gets past you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "So you're Judge Creep 'n Peep's real victim?": "",
  "Why lie about it, though? Couldn't you have admitted you and your girlfriend were taped?": "",
  "T-That's...": "",
  "But I thought Akari-chan was still in America...": "",
  "Akari-chan is Yosuke's girlfriend, I take it.": "",
  "Yep, they met through me, actually. But she's studying in America right now, so it's a long distance thing at the moment.": "",
  "But she didn't say anything to me about coming back. ...She's not back at all, is she?": "",
  "R-Right... She's still in America...": "",
  "That would mean you got caught in the hotel room with...": "",
  "Ah... ha ha... Yeah.": "",
  "I was in the room with someone else.": "",
  "Y-Yosuke! You cheated on Akari-chan!? You promised her you could handle a long distance relationship!": "",
  "D-Don't be mad, Tsukino...": "",
  "I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>am</font_kind> mad! And why did you lie to Yagami-san about this whole thing!?": "",
  "W-Well, you and Yagami-san seem to talk on a regular basis...": "",
  "So I was worried that if I told him the truth, you'd find out eventually...": "",
  "And then Akari would kill me and you'd blow up like you are now...": "",
  "So there you have it...": "",
  "Guilty. You're guilty as charged, Yosuke.": "",
  "Sorry, Yosuke, but you're going to need more than a lawyer to get you out of this one.": "",
  "I-I'm sorry.": "",
  "My brother really put you through the ringer, Yagami-san. I'm sorry.": "",
  "Nah, you're the real victim here, Tsukino-san. I'd say your brother's guilty of character assassination.": "",
  "Y-Yeah! Yagami-san almost got the wrong idea, Yosuke! Why don't you and I go have a few words!?": "",
  "Oh, and Yagami-san. Just so you know...": "",
  "I don't have a boyfriend!": "",
  "Okay?": "",
  "G-Goodbye!": "",
  "(I wasn't expecting the curve ball on that one...)　": "",
  "(But at least the whole Twisted Trio is locked up now. Gotta look on the bright side, right?)　": "",
  "Yes, I got your job request, so what do you say we talk business?": "",
  "Oh, are you Yagami-san, by any chance?": "",
  "This has something to do with a stolen jacket?": "",
  "Yeah, my bag got swiped, and it was in there.": "",
  "Where did you last see it?": "",
  "That's unfortunate. Can't take your eyes off anything in this city. Was anything else in the bag?": "",
  "In the park. I went to the bathroom and I accidentally left it in there...": "",
  "Was it gold studded or something?": "",
  "But when I realized what I'd done, I ran back, and it was already gone.": "",
  "Yeah, my wallet and my watch were in there too.": "",
  "Sure, I get that. And have you gone to the police?": "",
  "But the jacket is what matters. That thing means more to me than life itself.": "",
  "No, it's more of a sentimental value. My older brother gave it to me, and I really respect the guy.": "",
  "Pretty blunt, but I can see their point.": "",
  "I did, but they said they'd have an ice cube's chance in hell of finding it...": "",
  "Which park did you lose your bag in? And can you describe it?": "",
  "The Children's Park on Shichifuku Street. The bag is yellow with leather straps, a little smaller than a duffle bag.": "",
  "Great, thanks. Can you describe your jacket, wallet, and watch, too?": "",
  "My jacket's blue and white, and there's a tiger embroidered on the back. It says \"Tiger\" on it, too.": "",
  "My wallet's made of blue fabric and my watch is bright yellow.": "",
  "(I better get all this down...)": "",
  "Not gonna lie, that's expensive for me... But that jacket is worth any price.": "",
  "I'll be waiting for good news!": "",
  "All right. I can't promise anything, but I'll do my best to see if I can track them down.": "",
  "And you can cover 50,000 yen as my fee?": "",
  "Then I'll be in touch when I find it.": "",
  "(All right, guess I'll start at the park where he lost the bag.)": "",
  "Excuse me, sir.": "",
  "Eh? Whaddaya want?": "",
  "I'm looking for a bag that got lost around here, and I wanted to ask if maybe you'd seen it.": "",
  "Yeah? What kinda bag?": "",
  "A yellow one with leather straps. It got left in the bathroom and stolen.": "",
  "But it had a wallet and a jacket in it. Ring any bells?": "",
  "Hmm. Nah, I didn't see anything. But..": "",
  "See those homeless guys?": "",
  "Maybe they know. They're here dusk till dawn most of the time.": "",
  "I see. Thanks for the tip.": "",
  "Excuse me, I'm looking for a bag that got lost in this park. Did you see anything?": "",
  "No, no, not at all. I just thought you might've seen it since you're here a lot.": "",
  "(Those guys... Pretty sure these are the punks I'm trying to find.)": "",
  "Sorry, but do you guys have a quick second?": "",
  "I'm looking for a bag that went missing at the Children's Park bathroom.": "",
  "It had a wallet and a jacket in it.": "",
  "Nah, man.": "",
  "Yeah, you're barking up the wrong tree.": "",
  "So? You guys know anything about it?": "",
  "Yeah, sure. Yellow bag with a jacket in it.": "",
  "...All right. If you see anything, let me know, then.": "",
  "You gonna quit bugging us, asshole?": "",
  "(He says they don't know, but... Can I believe them?)": "",
  "Yeah, he totally did.": "",
  "Excuse me, just one more thing.": "",
  "What the fuck does it matter?": "",
  "It's just... something you said earlier is bothering me.": "",
  "You said \"Yellow bag with a jacket in it\" to confirm what I asked, right?": "",
  "Like I said, does it matter?": "",
  "Well, what does it fuckin' matter!? My bag's yellow too, okay? So I think it's time you got lost!": "",
  "It's just odd. You know something you shouldn't.": "",
  "Hey... that watch. Is that yours?": "",
  "'Course it is! Why are you still here!?": "",
  "(I bet I can trick this fool into confessing he stole it.)": "",
  "I'm not so sure. I bet the owner's prints are still on that watch.": "",
  "Well too bad for you, and I'm not taking it off!": "",
  "Fine. It's not like I have the authority to make you take it off, anyway.": "",
  "...Bro. What the fuck?": "",
  "(That didn't go according to plan.)": "",
  "You know what? I'm pretty sure the owner's initials are carved on the dial. Care to look?": "",
  "It doesn't have shit written on it, man!": "",
  "But if it was yours... Why'd you check?": "",
  "Time to admit that you stole it.": "",
  "N-Now you're just fucking with us, man!": "",
  "I'm about ready to kick your sorry ass outta here!": "",
  "Well, when words fail... Sometimes you've gotta do what you've gotta do.": "",
  "You'll be sorry, asshole!": "",
  "O-Oww...": "",
  "What the fuck were those moves...": "",
  "Unless you want to get hurt some more, I suggest you start talking. You stole the bag, right?": "",
  "Nng... Fine. I'll give you back the shit, man.": "",
  "This is just the wallet and the watch.": "",
  "Where's the bag, and more importantly, the jacket that was in it?": "",
  "I didn't wanna carry it around, so I threw it away.": "",
  "You threw it away? Really?": "",
  "Yeah, man, that thing was ugly as fuck. Tigers and shit... So lame.": "",
  "Ugh. Where did you toss it?": "",
  "I dropped the bag near a trash can in the Champion District. The jacket should be inside.": "",
  "Wow, right where he said it'd be.": "",
  "Uh oh. It's empty. ": "",
  "Hey man, we got booze, we got tits, and we're right around the corner. Wanna stop by?": "",
  "No, but... This is your usual territory, I take it?": "",
  "Huh? Yeah. The boobs in that bar ain't gonna sell themselves, believe me.": "",
  "Well, have you seen anything suspicious lately? Like, someone digging through the trash?": "",
  "Are you kidding? Homeless guys dig through this trash every night, man.": "",
  "Right, thanks. I'll go look around.": "",
  "Wait, aren't you gonna stop in for the bad boobs and booze!?": "",
  "Excuse me, can I ask you a question?": "",
  "That jacket you're wearing... You found it, right? It actually belongs to someone else who really values it...": "",
  "That's real tragic, but it's mine now.": "",
  "Finders keepers. It was gonna end up in the dump anyway, so I'm doing my civic duty. Recycling.": "",
  "No, it was thrown away by mistake. It's very special to him. Please give it back?": "",
  "Damn, you telling me to strip down to nothing in this weather? You telling me my life's worthless?": "",
  "No, I didn't mean that at all...": "",
  "It's warm, and I like it. I'm not giving it back!": "",
  "(Great... How am I going to get that guy to give it up?)": "",
  "All right, this look warms enough. Maybe that guy'll trade me the jacket for it.": "",
  "Hey, sir?": "",
  "What, back again? I said no!": "",
  "What do you think of this? It's warmer than that, right?": "",
  "And you'll give it to me?": "",
  "Yes... If you'll trade me the jacket you're wearing.": "",
  "Sure! We have a deal!": "",
  "(Great, I got it back. I better report in...)": "",
  "Hello? I have some good news about your jacket...": "",
  "I'm amazed you actually found it, Yagami-san! I had nearly lost all hope!": "",
  "Hm, but it kinda smells... Where did you find it?": "",
  "Eh, better that you don't know. Just take it to a dry cleaner or something, okay?": "",
  "Hey, it's back in your hands now, and that's what matters, right? Take good care of it.": "",
  "And yeah, I'll never let it leave my side again! Thanks a ton!": "",
  "I'm sorry, but you don't understand how important that jacket is.": "",
  "Could you please give it back?": "",
  "I said no! I've only got one layer on under this! If I take it off, I won't survive the night!": "",
  "That's probably what you want, isn't it!?": "",
  "No, I'm really not trying to say that at all...": "",
  "Then go away, ya thief!": "",
  "(For crying out loud... You'd think I was asking him to jump off a bridge...)": "",
  "(But I think this is his way of saying he wants a replacement... I just need to find something warm.)": "",
  "(That yellow wristwatch... It's gotta be my client's.)": "",
  "(I don't think anything else stands out...)": "",
  "Oh, you think we go around stealing bags 'cause we're homeless?": "",
  "It's a yellow bag with leather straps that got left in the bathroom.": "",
  "Yeah, I've seen it.": "",
  "Really!? Do you know what happened to it?": "",
  "I might, if you bring me two bento.": "",
  "Really? I need to bargain for this?": "",
  "Heh, sorry. I'm so hungry, my memory's all foggy.": "",
  "Let's make it a tonkatsu bento. The Poppo right around the corner has 'em.": "",
  "And say, let's make it two. We're both hungry, and I'm sure a full belly might jog my memory.": "",
  "(Well, I guess it's not too unreasonable.)": "",
  "Here, two bento boxes.": "",
  "Heh, thanks.": "",
  "C'mon Tori, you really gonna make Yagami-san run a stupid errand for you?": "",
  "Yagami-san here saved my life. Don't give him the runaround like that.": "",
  "Tch, fine, fine. No errands. I'll tell ya.": "",
  "Thanks, Kondo-san.": "",
  "It's nothin'.": "",
  "So, about that bag...": "",
  "There's been a buncha kids coming around here at night, hootin' and hollerin'. They're a real headache.": "",
  "But late the other night, they got really loud. Heard one of 'em say \"Score!\" and another say he'd buy the good shit.": "",
  "Anyway, they came boltin' outta the bathroom holding what looked like that bag you just described.": "",
  "That must be it, then. Did you get a look at the kids?": "",
  "Not really, except for the one that stood out like a douchebag.": "",
  "He had short bleached hair, a little pube-strand moustache, and stupid-ass tinted shades.": "",
  "They're local kids, so I'm sure they're around.": "",
  "Great. That helps a lot. Thanks!": "",
  "(But where would I find some local punks...)": "",
  "(Guess I better ask around. I wouldn't know where to begin.)": "",
  "Hey, Yosuke-kun. Got a sec?": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san. You finally ready to get busy on the best titty in the city?": "",
  "Uh, no, I'm working right now. Hoping you can help me find some punks.": "",
  "Oh, sucks to be you. What kinda punks?": "",
  "The local douchebag scene, apparently. They hang out at the Children's Park a lot, I hear.": "",
  "One of 'em has short, blonde hair, a moustache, and colored glasses. Sound familiar?": "",
  "Oh yeah, I know that dude.": "",
  "Really? Any idea where he might've gone?": "",
  "Hmm... What did he say again?": "",
  "Oh right! He was shouting about how he wanted to blow off some steam at the batting center.": "",
  "That's in the Hotel District, right?": "",
  "Thanks. I'll check it out.": "",
  "Yeah. What's bothering me is...": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "I-I'm sorry.": "ข-ขอโทษครับ",
  "Okay?": "แล้วไง?",
  "Heh, thanks.": "ฮึ ขอบใจ"
 }
}
